# T_SCRR: the printer port has no printer: asked at the start of the
# job, Retry asks again, No cancels.  Then SCREEN output, whose first
# request the test refuses as a server would, with an error on the
# location field.
K PGDN STAB SPACE CTRL-S
S NODEV
T Y
S AGAIN
T N
S CANCEL
K SPACE SPACE CTRL-S
S FIELDERR
K ESC
